{"3670580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TownsFolk", "steam_appid": 3670580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/943e97170a2ee340b516a8f245085309.apng?t=1779357977\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/943e97170a2ee340b516a8f245085309.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=40 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide a handful of settlers</strong> as they create a village in the wild. Manage resources and grow your settlement carefully. Watch your community evolve from a fragile camp into a thriving outpost. Every decision you make influences how they adapt to the untamed world around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/00b6d4ba386b05586267e67faddb06b2.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/00b6d4ba386b05586267e67faddb06b2.webm?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/00b6d4ba386b05586267e67faddb06b2.mp4?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/2f709527798b34bb7e570b5817b5531d.apng?t=1779357977\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/2f709527798b34bb7e570b5817b5531d.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the fog-covered land.</strong> Each new tile holds risks, rewards, and choices that shape your story. Explore the unknown as the world reveals itself piece by piece, offering surprises and dangers in equal measure. Your path unfolds only as you dare to uncover it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/076582a5bbfb613ec238bb661b9889a5.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/076582a5bbfb613ec238bb661b9889a5.webm?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/076582a5bbfb613ec238bb661b9889a5.mp4?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/20980965c4c08d29c98c793ab55b3dec.apng?t=1779357977\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/20980965c4c08d29c98c793ab55b3dec.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=39 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide how your people live and survive.</strong> Your calls affect their future and their fate. Balance safety, ambition, and the needs of a growing frontier. Every choice leaves a mark on the world and on the settlers who trust you to guide them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/bbf818ab041a895f1b24e71e1ad2375b.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/bbf818ab041a895f1b24e71e1ad2375b.webm?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/bbf818ab041a895f1b24e71e1ad2375b.mp4?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And don't forget, Strategy is key...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves carefully. Each session brings fresh challenges, dynamic events, from disasters to tribute deadlines. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/d9d6e83690a8b775f6f4cfe542fe83f3.apng?t=1779357977\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/d9d6e83690a8b775f6f4cfe542fe83f3.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=39 /></picture></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode with handcrafted missions across five regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real time or Turn-based settlement building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Mode for endless gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather system affecting gameplay and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps for high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable Factions with unique traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjacency bonuses and tile-based synergies</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/943e97170a2ee340b516a8f245085309.apng?t=1779357977\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/943e97170a2ee340b516a8f245085309.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=40 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide a handful of settlers</strong> as they create a village in the wild. Manage resources and grow your settlement carefully. Watch your community evolve from a fragile camp into a thriving outpost. Every decision you make influences how they adapt to the untamed world around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/00b6d4ba386b05586267e67faddb06b2.poster.avif?t=1779357977\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/00b6d4ba386b05586267e67faddb06b2.webm?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/00b6d4ba386b05586267e67faddb06b2.mp4?t=1779357977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/2f709527798b34bb7e570b5817b5531d.apng?t=1779357977\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670580/extras/2f709527798b34bb7e570b5817b5531d.poster.avif?t=17793579